# Soil Organic Carbon (SOC) Monitoring Platform

A scalable, browser-based platform for quantifying and mapping SOC across agricultural regions using real remote sensing APIs, spectral indices, and an on-device AI/ML prediction engine.

---

## Proposed Architecture

```
Soil/
├── index.html          # Single-page app shell + routing
├── css/
│   └── style.css       # Design system (dark agri theme)
├── js/
│   ├── app.js          # App init, router, state management
│   ├── map.js          # Leaflet map, polygon drawing, layer toggling
│   ├── api.js          # All external API calls
│   ├── ml.js           # SOC estimation model (regression engine)
│   ├── charts.js       # Chart.js dashboard components
│   └── export.js       # CSV / GeoJSON export
└── assets/
    └── icons/          # SVG icons, logos
```

---

