### JavaScript Modules

#### [NEW] [js/api.js](file:///Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil/js/api.js)
Integrates 4 free, no-auth APIs:

| API | Endpoint | Data Returned |
|---|---|---|
| **SoilGrids v2** | `rest.isric.org/soilgrids/v2.0` | SOC (g/kg), pH, clay, bulk density |
| **Open-Meteo** | `api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast` | Temp, precipitation, soil moisture |
| **NASA POWER** | `power.larc.nasa.gov/api/temporal` | Solar radiation, NDVI proxies |
| **Nominatim** | `nominatim.openstreetmap.org` | Geocoding / reverse geocoding |

#### [NEW] [js/ml.js](file:///Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil/js/ml.js)
On-device SOC estimation engine using validated literature coefficients:
- **Input covariates**: NDVI, EVI, BSI, clay%, bulk density, MAP, MAT, elevation
- **Model**: Gaussian Process Regression (simplified polynomial approximation using published SOC-spectral relationships from Viscarra Rossel et al., 2016)
- **Outputs**: SOC (%), carbon stock (t C/ha), uncertainty range, carbon sequestration potential

Spectral index formulas embedded:
```
NDVI = (NIR - Red) / (NIR + Red)
EVI  = 2.5 × (NIR - Red) / (NIR + 6×Red - 7.5×Blue + 1)
BSI  = ((Red + SWIR1) - (NIR + Blue)) / ((Red + SWIR1) + (NIR + Blue))
```

#### [NEW] [js/map.js](file:///Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil/js/map.js)
Leaflet.js interactive map:
- Multiple base layers: OSM, ESRI Satellite, OpenTopoMap
- Leaflet.draw for field polygon drawing
- Heatmap overlay for SOC values across points
- Marker popups with SOC readings
- Layer control panel

#### [NEW] [js/charts.js](file:///Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil/js/charts.js)
Chart.js powered analytics:
- SOC trend line chart (temporal)
- Carbon stock bar chart by field
- Climate correlation scatter plot
- Confidence interval area chart
- Soil property radar chart

#### [NEW] [js/export.js](file:///Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil/js/export.js)
- Export field data as **CSV**
- Export field geometry as **GeoJSON**
- Print-friendly report generation

#### [NEW] [js/app.js](file:///Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil/js/app.js)
Main application controller:
- Tab/section navigation
- Global state store (fields, API results, predictions)
- Event bus for cross-module communication
- Location search + auto-pan map

---

## Key Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| Field Drawing | Leaflet.draw polygon tool |
| SOC Mapping | SoilGrids API + ML interpolation |
| Remote Sensing | Spectral index computation (NDVI, EVI, BSI, NDWI) |
| Climate Context | Open-Meteo + NASA POWER |
| AI Prediction | Regression model with confidence bounds |
| Temporal Trends | Historical chart from monthly API queries |
| Export | CSV, GeoJSON download |

