## Verification Plan

### Automated / Browser Tests
1. **Start local server** → `cd /Users/niteshyadav/Desktop/Soil && python3 -m http.server 8080`
2. Open `http://localhost:8080` in browser subagent
3. Verify each section renders (Dashboard, Map, Analysis, Reports)
4. Verify SoilGrids API call returns data for test coords (18.5204°N, 73.8567°E — Pune, India)
5. Verify ML engine outputs SOC %, carbon stock, sequestration
6. Verify Leaflet map loads with satellite layer
7. Verify Chart.js dashboard renders all 5 chart types

### Manual Verification
1. Draw a polygon on the map → confirm SOC analysis panel populates
2. Search a location → confirm map re-centers
3. Click "Export CSV" → confirm file downloads with correct headers

